;br&gt;Default expression: null" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n15"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="15.00" width="780.00" height="175.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870.00" y="600.00" width="820.00" height="205.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="var.policy_compartment_ocid&lt;br&gt;Compartment OCID where the IAM policy is created. Defaults to tenancy_ocid.&lt;br&gt;Default expression: null" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n17"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="15.00" width="780.00" height="175.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="These inputs identify separately managed resources or override a default selection. The overview and module call-site decide their use.&lt;br&gt;Null/empty defaults do not prove that an external resource exists. Input names and defaults are source contracts, not discovered cloud inventory.&lt;br&gt;Collection inputs can contain further resource references; consult their source schemas and the overview prerequisites. No ownership adoption is implied." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="855.00" width="2540.00" height="130.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
